<br>I don't want to sound like I'm being childish but anyway one night I doing a raid with the guild and was fun until I died. Well thats wasn't the problem, the problem started when I couldn't get bck to the fight because I had no way there. I was in GFD and needed a port to Lava to continue the fight but no on ein the immediate area wouldn't even help me and there where 125 people on, sad, but true and you know thats a long walk with no armor or weapon . So I let the guild know the situation and no one even offered or helped me they rather didnt respond or they didn't care. Sorry dont mean to complain but if a raid is on I would want every1 there to participate. My suggestion is to please help other guildsman in situations like this or worse to get them bck in the fight. Hope i don't step on any toes here, and I respect every player in the guild. Thanks for hearing my suggestion(complaint) hehe and Hail Norrath Militia.</font></tt><p>
